  positionTitle: Social Media Manager
  jobDescription: Run Synergix's social media. Make us look cool. We are not cool.
    That is the challenge.
  bossMemo: 'Our social media account has 11 followers. Four of them are my mom.


    Corporate
    wants us to ''go viral'' and ''connect with the youth''. Please hire someone
    who knows what a meme is.


    Also, after a recent ''incident'' involving the
    night shift and a ham, HR has added a rule about how many people an employee
    can be.


    - Dale'
  newRules:
  - Follower counts and 'viral' claims must be confirmed in the interview.
  - Each applicant must be exactly one (1) human.
